{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e05-scene-20",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "第一个节目策划  (My First Approved Proposal)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "wen_simo": "闻思默"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "On taping day in the studio, host Wen Simo welcomes Xin Huimei's fan-club president onstage while Bu Xiaogu watches from the floor and reflects on finishing her very first show proposal. Listen to the Mandarin lines first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我竟这样完成了我的第一个策划。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这次不是为了理想，而是为了一个人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果让过去的布小谷知道，她一定会吐槽现在的我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "今天我们有幸请到了爱美会的会长许天泽先生，欢迎您！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那个让我仰望的人，就像理想一样。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "靠近他的时候，脚下总是荆棘遍地。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他一次次把我的幻想打碎。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "却又一次次带我看到他更真实的面孔。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "许久后我才明白，当我忘掉过去的自己。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我已经踏入他的制作殿堂。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我竟这样完成了我的第一个策划。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That was how I unexpectedly completed my very first show proposal.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这次不是为了理想，而是为了一个人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This time it was not for an ideal, but for a person.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果让过去的布小谷知道，她一定会吐槽现在的我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If the old Bu Xiaogu knew, she would surely tease the person I am today.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "今天我们有幸请到了爱美会的会长许天泽先生，欢迎您！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Today we have the honour of welcoming fan-club president Mr Xu Tianze; welcome!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那个让我仰望的人，就像理想一样。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The person I look up to is just like a distant ideal.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "靠近他的时候，脚下总是荆棘遍地。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Whenever I step closer to him, the path underfoot is full of thorns.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他一次次把我的幻想打碎。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Again and again, he shatters my illusions.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "却又一次次带我看到他更真实的面孔。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet again and again, he lets me see his truer face.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "许久后我才明白，当我忘掉过去的自己。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Only much later did I realise that once I forgot my former self.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我已经踏入他的制作殿堂。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I had already stepped into his world of production.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我竟这样完成了我的第一个策划。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这次不是为了理想，而是为了一个人。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果让过去的布小谷知道，她一定会吐槽现在的我。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "今天我们有幸请到了爱美会的会长许天泽先生，欢迎您！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那个让我仰望的人，就像理想一样。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "靠近他的时候，脚下总是荆棘遍地。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他一次次把我的幻想打碎。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "却又一次次带我看到他更真实的面孔。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "许久后我才明白，当我忘掉过去的自己。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我已经踏入他的制作殿堂。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Letting go of her old illusions, Xiaogu steps into the real world of television production beside Chun Yuqiao. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "下次见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
